      "index": 3,
      "type": "image",
      "weight": 0.3,
      "score": 0,
      "reasoning": "Mode A. None of the AI-generated figures reproduces or substantively addresses the target comparison of observed cumulative loss with GlacierMIP2/CMIP6 projections through 2040 and 2100; emission scenarios, projection envelopes, sea-level-equivalent axes, and future-loss ranges are all absent. The observational cumulative-loss plot ends near 2023/2024 and cannot support the required future-outlook conclusions."
